     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "An integration test fails occasionally, likely because the initial commit incompletely addressed the concurrency issues.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "See ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2274?focusedCommentId=52520&page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-52520"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2274?focusedCommentId=52520&page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-52520",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Since the bug wasn't introduced by either of those commits, I think we can still move forward with this, but be aware that we have more items to fix.  It any other other shortcomings can be evaluated as part of FCREPO-2274, and either fixed quickly and back-ported, or logged as bugs.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
